\begin{enumerate}
\item "Can you provide any evidence to support your claim that human activity is the main cause of climate change?"
\item "What about natural factors, such as volcanic eruptions and solar radiation? Could they also be contributing to climate change?"
\item "What are some potential solutions to address climate change? How effective do you think they would be?"
\end{enumerate}
