\section{Conclusion}
The Socratic Method is a powerful teaching tool that can be used to stimulate critical thinking and to draw out ideas and underlying presumptions. By asking questions and encouraging discussion, teachers can help students to develop a deeper understanding of the topic at hand and to think more critically about the world around them.
